Google product taxonomy, one file per language:

  google_taxonomy_tr.json
  google_taxonomy_en.json

Shape: a flat object of category id to full path.

  {
    "1":   "Animals & Pet Supplies",
    "371": "Home & Garden > Kitchen & Dining > Kitchen Appliances > Coffee Makers & Espresso Machines"
  }

Built by hand from Google's published list:
  https://www.google.com/basepages/producttype/taxonomy-with-ids.<locale>.txt

Not downloaded at runtime. Google last revised the taxonomy in 2021, so there
is nothing to keep in sync, and half the hosts this software runs on cannot
make an outbound HTTPS connection with a working certificate store anyway.

The product screen stores the id. Google accepts either the id or the full path
in the feed; the id is language-independent and survives a category rename.
